# GitHub Integration Rules for Ephemeral Bubble Conversations

## Project Context
- **Description**: This project is an ephemeral bubble conversations application.
- **Structure**: Follow the existing architecture patterns when generating new code.

## Code Generation Rules
- Generate code that follows the existing style and patterns in the project
- Prefer functional components for React
- Follow clean code principles with proper comments
- Ensure proper error handling in all async operations

## GitHub Workflow
- **Commit Messages**: Use conventional commit format (feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore)
- **PR Format**: Include detailed description of changes and reference related issues

## Testing Guidelines
- Write unit tests for all new functionality
- Ensure tests are meaningful and not just for coverage

## Documentation
- Update documentation when changing APIs or adding features
- Include JSDoc comments for functions and components
